00:19:23,945 --> 00:19:26,185
and go outside. Intercept him
at the parking lot entrance.

266
00:19:26,265 --> 00:19:28,145
I'll go after him using the stairs.
We'll corner him.

267
00:19:30,585 --> 00:19:32,465
Is there anything I can help with?

268
00:20:17,585 --> 00:20:19,425
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

269
00:20:29,345 --> 00:20:30,105
Get lost.

270
00:20:38,305 --> 00:20:39,185
Wu Shanlong!

271
00:20:40,385 --> 00:20:41,265
Stop!

272
00:20:54,105 --> 00:20:54,945
What the heck?

273
00:21:03,585 --> 00:21:04,425
Is this his car?

274
00:21:05,625 --> 00:21:08,145
He! He's here!

275
00:21:08,745 --> 00:21:11,345
I've locked the door to the stairs!
Are there any more exits?

276
00:21:11,425 --> 00:21:12,705
The parking lot entrance.

277
00:21:13,225 --> 00:21:16,065
The parking lot entrance
was opened last week!

278
00:21:16,145 --> 00:21:18,265
He might be able to exit from there!

279
00:21:20,705 --> 00:21:21,745
Stop!

280
00:21:22,825 --> 00:21:23,865
Catch him!

281
00:21:27,305 --> 00:21:28,945
Move! Move!

282
00:21:29,945 --> 00:21:31,145
Move!

283
00:21:31,225 --> 00:21:32,705
What are you doing?

284
00:21:33,745 --> 00:21:34,665
He went that way!

285
00:22:25,865 --> 00:22:26,985
After him!

286
00:23:40,825 --> 00:23:41,825
He!

287
00:23:44,145 --> 00:23:45,065
He!

288
00:23:48,065 --> 00:23:49,145
He!

289
00:23:54,425 --> 00:23:55,265
He!

290
00:23:59,025 --> 00:24:00,505
Quick, call an ambulance!

291
00:24:01,625 --> 00:24:03,225
Stay awake, He!

292
00:24:07,945 --> 00:24:08,785
He!

293
00:24:10,185 --> 00:24:11,465
Stay awake, He!

294
00:24:21,105 --> 00:24:22,425
He!

295
00:24:54,225 --> 00:24:56,185
The steel rod pierced his lung

296
00:24:56,265 --> 00:24:57,505
and broke his rib.

297
00:24:58,185 --> 00:25:00,465
Thankfully, Officer He is lucky.

298
00:25:00,545 --> 00:25:01,465
A few centimeters above,

299
00:25:02,705 --> 00:25:04,305
and it'd have pierced his heart.

300
00:25:04,385 --> 00:25:05,985
The consequences could've been worse.

301
00:25:06,985 --> 00:25:09,345
You must do your best to treat him.

302
00:25:10,025 --> 00:25:12,025
There mustn't be any complications.

303
00:25:12,625 --> 00:25:15,705
He is the hero of the police force.

304
00:25:15,785 --> 00:25:16,705
Don't worry.

305
00:25:17,585 --> 00:25:18,705
Thank you.

306
00:25:27,625 --> 00:25:28,545
Sir!

307
00:25:31,625 --> 00:25:32,545
Sir!

308
00:25:36,345 --> 00:25:37,305
Sir!

309
00:25:43,505 --> 00:25:45,105
Are you all right, sir?

310
00:25:54,505 --> 00:25:55,385
He.

311
00:25:59,265 --> 00:26:01,865
He. Are you all right, He?

312
00:26:08,425 --> 00:26:09,265
FOLDER

313
00:26:10,865 --> 00:26:12,665
-Be careful.
-Be careful.

314
00:26:18,185 --> 00:26:19,265
Dad.

315
00:26:22,785 --> 00:26:23,825
I'm fine.

316
00:26:25,665 --> 00:26:26,505
Are you really fine?

317
00:26:27,425 --> 00:26:29,425
I said I'm fine.

318
00:26:34,225 --> 00:26:35,185
Anyway, He,

319
00:26:35,265 --> 00:26:38,385
why did you suddenly think
of bringing Xiaohe

320
00:26:38,465 --> 00:26:40,385
to Yuanlongli's internet cafe
to search for clues?

321
00:26:41,665 --> 00:26:43,705
Ran brought us there.

322
00:26:54,265 --> 00:26:55,105
Ran.

323
00:26:55,185 --> 00:26:57,425
Don't just stand there.

324
00:26:57,945 --> 00:26:59,465
Tell everyone about it.

325
00:27:01,305 --> 00:27:02,185
No way.

326
00:27:07,305 --> 00:27:08,585
Yes.

327
00:27:08,665 --> 00:27:10,745
Did you hear what he just said?

328
00:27:12,705 --> 00:27:15,865
I… What did he just say?

329
00:27:15,945 --> 00:27:17,945
Stop playing dumb.

330
00:27:20,105 --> 00:27:21,345
He was scolding you.

331
00:27:21,425 --> 00:27:23,625
He said you were biased towards Qu Dahai.

332
00:27:24,225 --> 00:27:26,185
Xiaohe found the lead,

333
00:27:26,785 --> 00:27:28,625
but you gave Qu Dahai the case

334
00:27:28,705 --> 00:27:31,105
and even stopped Xiaohe
from joining the task force.

335
00:27:31,185 --> 00:27:34,305
Is the criminal department
trying to steal credit too?

336
00:27:34,825 --> 00:27:35,625
Captain,

337
00:27:35,705 --> 00:27:37,265
I did it for Xiaohe's sake.

338
00:27:37,345 --> 00:27:40,425
Wasn't Xiaohe kidnapped
when she was a child?

339
00:27:40,505 --> 00:27:42,385
I was afraid that she
might relive those memories

340
00:27:42,465 --> 00:27:43,665
after joining the task force.

341
00:27:43,745 --> 00:27:46,225
What if it triggered… What you call it…

342
00:27:46,305 --> 00:27:48,865
Hush. I can't hear him.

343
00:27:56,025 --> 00:27:56,865
You hear that?

344
00:27:56,945 --> 00:27:58,185
He's scolding you.

345
00:27:58,945 --> 00:27:59,785
Are you talking to me?

346
00:27:59,865 --> 00:28:01,705
Captain Ran said

347
00:28:01,785 --> 00:28:04,345
the internet cafe owner you arrested

348
00:28:04,425 --> 00:28:07,225
wasn't a kidnapping suspect.

349
00:28:07,305 --> 00:28:09,865
You are only wasting your time
by interrogating him.

350
00:28:09,945 --> 00:28:14,025
Also, Ran taught you
the Tremaux Algorithm.

351
00:28:14,105 --> 00:28:16,225
Shouldn't you provide guidance
to Xiaohe now?

352
00:28:19,865 --> 00:28:21,145
Dad,

353
00:28:21,225 --> 00:28:23,265
you've had a long day.

354
00:28:23,345 --> 00:28:24,185
Let's go home.

355
00:28:25,425 --> 00:28:27,865
Uncle Ran still has a train to catch.

356
00:28:49,785 --> 00:28:50,625
He Xiaohe.

357
00:28:51,505 --> 00:28:52,345
Yes.

358
00:28:53,265 --> 00:28:54,545
As long as you won't affect

359
00:28:55,065 --> 00:28:57,145
the Special Task Force's investigation,

360
00:28:57,225 --> 00:28:58,185
I will give you special permission

361
00:28:58,265 --> 00:28:59,945
to assist in the investigation
of Han Zi'ang's case.

362
00:29:00,705 --> 00:29:02,425
However, you must report all your actions

363
00:29:02,505 --> 00:29:04,145
to the team leader of the task force.

364
00:29:06,985 --> 00:29:08,025
Thank you, Captain.

365
00:29:08,105 --> 00:29:09,545
-Hold on…
-Enough.

366
00:29:11,825 --> 00:29:14,025
Captain, many parents are outside.

367
00:29:23,865 --> 00:29:26,065
I'm warning you. Don't pull
this trick often in the future.

368
00:29:41,545 --> 00:29:43,105
Train harder

369
00:29:43,945 --> 00:29:45,905
if you want to outwit me.

370
00:30:35,465 --> 00:30:37,025
CRIMINAL DEPARTMENT OFFICE

371
00:31:01,145 --> 00:31:01,985
He.

372
00:31:05,105 --> 00:31:07,065
He. You're awake.

373
00:31:07,145 --> 00:31:10,025
-Let me call a doctor.
-Wait. There's no rush.

374
00:31:11,025 --> 00:31:12,385
Water.

375
00:31:24,185 --> 00:31:25,065
Right away.

376
00:31:34,545 --> 00:31:35,545
How's that?

377
00:31:43,345 --> 00:31:44,305
Here.

378
00:31:49,945 --> 00:31:50,905
Brat,

379
00:31:51,545 --> 00:31:52,825
are you trying to scald me?

380
00:31:53,945 --> 00:31:54,945
Let me add some cold water.

381
00:31:55,025 --> 00:31:56,345
No need.

382
00:31:57,745 --> 00:31:59,905
-Then, I'll go and find a doctor.
-Wait.

383
00:32:02,225 --> 00:32:03,065
Talk to me about the case.

384
00:32:04,825 --> 00:32:06,145
Where's Wu Shanlong?

385
00:32:07,425 --> 00:32:08,945
He was pierced by steel rods

386
00:32:09,025 --> 00:32:11,065
and couldn't be resuscitated. He is dead.

387
00:32:17,825 --> 00:32:21,105
The people in the forensic department
found a small amount

388
00:32:21,185 --> 00:32:23,185
of human bone samples
in the bathroom's drain.

389
00:32:23,825 --> 00:32:25,265
After examination,

390
00:32:25,345 --> 00:32:27,985
it matches the DNA
found on Xu Zhihong's hair

391
00:32:28,065 --> 00:32:28,905
collected at Xu's apartment.

392
00:32:29,745 --> 00:32:30,665
Moreover,

393
00:32:30,745 --> 00:32:33,265
the skin samples found in the blue heels

394
00:32:33,345 --> 00:32:35,105
also match Xu Meng's DNA.

395
00:32:35,185 --> 00:32:37,225
Combined with Wu Zhengxiong's

396
00:32:37,305 --> 00:32:39,105
and Hu Anping's testimony…

397
00:32:39,185 --> 00:32:41,105
In 1997, Wu Shanlong

398
00:32:41,185 --> 00:32:42,545
hired Wolfie to murder someone.

399
00:32:42,625 --> 00:32:44,065
Wu Shanlong said

400
00:32:44,585 --> 00:32:47,465
he went and did the deed himself.

401
00:32:48,185 --> 00:32:49,065
We can basically confirm

402
00:32:50,145 --> 00:32:52,385
that Wu Shanlong is the murderer
of Xu Meng and her father.

403
00:32:54,385 --> 00:32:55,345
Are there any accomplices?

404
00:32:56,145 --> 00:32:57,065
None has been found at the moment.

405
00:32:59,345 --> 00:33:00,265
What about the motive?

406
00:33:01,185 --> 00:33:03,425
According to the information
we have currently,

407
00:33:03,505 --> 00:33:06,545
my guess is that Wu Shanlong
had a strong urge to control women

408
00:33:06,625 --> 00:33:09,065
due to his physiological defect.

409
00:33:09,145 --> 00:33:11,265
He visited the foot massage parlor
frequently with Song Qingsong.

410
00:33:11,345 --> 00:33:14,105
<i>He had his eyes on Xu Meng</i>
<i>and wanted her to himself.</i>

411
00:33:14,185 --> 00:33:15,025
MUSE FOOT MASSAGE

412
00:33:15,105 --> 00:33:16,825
<i>After Song Qingsong decided</i>
<i>to hire him to murder the victims,</i>

413
00:33:17,665 --> 00:33:19,585
<i>Wu Shanlong lied</i>
<i>and used Wolfie as a scapegoat.</i>

414
00:33:19,665 --> 00:33:22,185
<i>He then purposely helped</i>
<i>Xu Meng and her father</i>

415
00:33:22,265 --> 00:33:24,745
<i>to disappear to escape debt.</i>

416
00:33:24,825 --> 00:33:27,945
<i>Xu Meng thought Wu Shanlong</i>
<i>helped her out of kindness.</i>

417
00:33:28,025 --> 00:33:30,145
<i>To her surprise, he was actually trying</i>
<i>to take her by force</i>

418
00:33:30,225 --> 00:33:31,305
<i>after she successfully escaped.</i>

419
00:33:31,905 --> 00:33:34,305
Wu Shanlong faced resistance
from Xu Meng and her father,

420
00:33:34,385 --> 00:33:37,345
and he was afraid of Song Qingsong
finding out about his plan.

421
00:33:37,425 --> 00:33:38,745
In the end,

422
00:33:39,745 --> 00:33:40,985
he killed them both.

423
00:33:49,145 --> 00:33:50,425
Unfortunately,

424
00:33:51,745 --> 00:33:53,625
we couldn't find Xu Meng's body.

425
00:33:57,225 --> 00:34:03,225
NANSHAN BRANCH
BUILDING NO. 1, INPATIENT DEPARTMENT

426
00:34:10,784 --> 00:34:11,625
Xiaohe.

427
00:34:14,065 --> 00:34:15,105
Xiaohe!

428
00:34:32,344 --> 00:34:33,425
Mrs. He,

429
00:34:33,505 --> 00:34:34,905
you're right on time.

430
00:34:34,985 --> 00:34:36,025
He just woke up.

431
00:34:40,625 --> 00:34:41,465
Take a seat.

432
00:34:58,625 --> 00:34:59,545
Xiaohe.

433
00:35:09,985 --> 00:35:11,225
I've not seen you for ages.

434
00:35:12,145 --> 00:35:13,065
You've lost weight.

435
00:35:14,825 --> 00:35:16,345
You are in such bad shape.

436
00:35:16,425 --> 00:35:17,425
It's fine.

437
00:35:18,305 --> 00:35:19,465
Just a minor wound.

438
00:35:23,465 --> 00:35:24,305
Xiaohe,

439
00:35:25,025 --> 00:35:27,705
I've achieved something huge this time.

440
00:35:27,785 --> 00:35:31,465
The criminal used a steel rod this long
to stab me at this place,

441
00:35:32,145 --> 00:35:34,265
and I didn't even let out a groan.

442
00:35:34,345 --> 00:35:36,545
I even beat up the criminal.

443
00:35:40,425 --> 00:35:43,265
So you risked your life
just to achieve something.

444
00:35:43,985 --> 00:35:45,545
You are no longer young.

445
00:35:45,625 --> 00:35:46,985
In the future,

446
00:35:47,665 --> 00:35:49,585
you must take good care of yourself.

447
00:36:26,425 --> 00:36:27,865
I've talked to you about this.

448
00:36:40,705 --> 00:36:42,385
DIVORCE AGREEMENT

449
00:36:47,545 --> 00:36:49,425
Our marriage has become like this

450
00:36:49,945 --> 00:36:51,385
for a while now.

451
00:36:52,265 --> 00:36:54,185
It's bad for everyone if this goes on.

452
00:36:55,505 --> 00:36:57,065
Why not just let it go

453
00:36:57,825 --> 00:36:58,945
and end it cleanly?

454
00:37:09,465 --> 00:37:11,945
Actually, I've been trying to talk
to you about this.

455
00:37:12,945 --> 00:37:14,425
But I've been busy with the investigation.

456
00:37:16,465 --> 00:37:17,305
Give me a pen.

457
00:37:40,025 --> 00:37:43,185
HUSBAND'S SIGNATURE
WIFE'S SIGNATURE: SUN YUN

458
00:37:47,425 --> 00:37:48,465
What's wrong?

459
00:37:51,705 --> 00:37:54,865
CUSTODY OF THE CHILD, HE XIAOHE
GOES TO THE WIFE

460
00:37:56,585 --> 00:37:58,945
I'll soon transfer
to the provincial headquarters.

461
00:37:59,025 --> 00:38:00,145
I'll bring Xiaohe with me.

462
00:38:00,225 --> 00:38:03,345
This is better for her.
Look at you right now.

463
00:38:03,425 --> 00:38:05,425
How can you even take care of her?

464
00:38:09,985 --> 00:38:12,625
Xiaohe is becoming more rebellious now.

465
00:38:12,705 --> 00:38:14,145
If she stays here,

466
00:38:14,225 --> 00:38:16,785
it won't be too long
until she goes astray.

467
00:38:17,785 --> 00:38:19,705
You don't need to pay alimony.

468
00:38:20,225 --> 00:38:22,185
I can support her on my own.

469
00:38:22,265 --> 00:38:23,745
If you miss her,

470
00:38:23,825 --> 00:38:25,945
you may visit her at any time.
I won't stop you.

471
00:38:30,545 --> 00:38:31,945
Do you hear me?

472
00:38:33,705 --> 00:38:34,705
He Yuanhang.

473
00:38:36,865 --> 00:38:38,425
He Yuanhang!

474
00:38:41,585 --> 00:38:43,145
I don't object to the divorce.

475
00:38:43,665 --> 00:38:46,545
We all want to seek happiness,
and I have nothing to say about that.

476
00:38:46,625 --> 00:38:48,145
Don't use me as an excuse in the future.

477
00:38:48,225 --> 00:38:50,345
I'm sick of hearing,
"It's for Xiaohe's sake."

478
00:38:51,585 --> 00:38:53,225
I'll decide how I live my life.

479
00:38:53,745 --> 00:38:54,585
I'm not going to the provincial capital.

480
00:38:54,665 --> 00:38:57,625
Xiaohe. The adults are talking.
Don't cause any trouble.

481
00:38:58,265 --> 00:39:00,225
The adults also shouldn't cause
any trouble for the child.

482
00:39:00,305 --> 00:39:01,785
The schools in the provincial capital
are so much better

483
00:39:01,865 --> 00:39:02,905
than the ones in Weiyang.

484
00:39:02,985 --> 00:39:06,025
Attending university or studying abroad
will be so much easier in the future.

485
00:39:06,105 --> 00:39:08,105
Don't you like music?

486
00:39:08,185 --> 00:39:10,545
England. The United States. France.

487
00:39:10,625 --> 00:39:12,305
No matter where you want to go,
I'll also support you.

488
00:39:12,385 --> 00:39:13,785
I don't need anyone to decide for me.

489
00:39:13,865 --> 00:39:16,065
He Xiaohe. I am your guardian.

490
00:39:16,145 --> 00:39:17,305
As long as you are still a minor,

491
00:39:17,385 --> 00:39:19,585
you need my consent
before you make your decisions.

492
00:39:19,665 --> 00:39:20,825
This is non-negotiable.

493
00:39:20,905 --> 00:39:23,105
If that's the case,
it's also non-negotiable for me.

494
00:39:23,185 --> 00:39:24,145
I'm following Dad.

495
00:39:25,065 --> 00:39:27,905
Look at her. She's really stubborn,

496
00:39:27,985 --> 00:39:30,225
just like you.
She won't be able to turn good.

497
00:39:51,945 --> 00:39:54,225
CUSTODY OF THE CHILD, HE XIAOHE
GOES TO THE HUSBAND

498
00:40:04,705 --> 00:40:08,305
HUSBAND'S SIGNATURE: HE

499
00:40:32,105 --> 00:40:34,025
What is it? You don't want her to leave?

500
00:40:37,865 --> 00:40:40,505
Xiaohe, I have raised an amazing daughter.

501
00:40:41,105 --> 00:40:42,785
-Give me a hug.
-Don't be so full of yourself.

502
00:40:42,865 --> 00:40:45,665
Not leaving with Mom
has nothing to do with you.

503
00:40:46,825 --> 00:40:47,665
What do you mean?

504
00:40:47,745 --> 00:40:50,385
My friends, my band,

505
00:40:50,465 --> 00:40:51,545
and my rock career are all in Weiyang.

506
00:40:51,625 --> 00:40:52,905
Listen now.

507
00:40:52,985 --> 00:40:54,665
Leave me alone in the future.

508
00:40:54,745 --> 00:40:56,225
But I am your only parent now.

509
00:40:56,305 --> 00:40:57,505
You don't agree?

510
00:40:58,025 --> 00:40:59,905
Mom just left.
I'll call her back right away.

511
00:40:59,985 --> 00:41:01,425
I agree.

512
00:41:05,705 --> 00:41:06,785
I agree.

513
00:41:07,785 --> 00:41:08,905
Take good care of yourself.

514
00:41:09,985 --> 00:41:11,345
I still have lessons in the afternoon.

515
00:42:26,505 --> 00:42:30,585
Family is a strange thing.

516
00:42:33,385 --> 00:42:35,505
If the family is intact,

517
00:42:36,745 --> 00:42:38,505
people dig it

518
00:42:40,625 --> 00:42:42,865
until there's a hole.

519
00:42:43,905 --> 00:42:45,185
If it isn't intact,

520
00:42:47,425 --> 00:42:49,105
people will do their best to repair it.

521
00:42:50,705 --> 00:42:51,745
They will even

522
00:42:52,625 --> 00:42:55,625
do something as stupid
as repairing a golden bowl

523
00:42:56,705 --> 00:42:57,745
with a piece of tile.

524
00:43:26,945 --> 00:43:28,065
What is it?

525
00:43:29,105 --> 00:43:29,905
Take a guess.

526
00:43:33,105 --> 00:43:33,945
No.

527
00:43:43,305 --> 00:43:45,585
CERTIFICATE OF HONOR

528
00:43:45,665 --> 00:43:46,865
"In the June 30th case,

529
00:43:46,945 --> 00:43:50,185
Officer He Yuanhang demonstrated
keen investigative thinking,

530
00:43:50,265 --> 00:43:53,265
exceptional judgment,
a strong sense of responsibility,

531
00:43:53,345 --> 00:43:55,345
and extensive investigative experience.

532
00:43:55,425 --> 00:43:58,145
He made significant contributions
in solving the case.

533
00:44:00,145 --> 00:44:02,145
To commend his exemplary performance
and promote integrity,

534
00:44:02,225 --> 00:44:03,585
in accordance
with the People's Police Rewards

535
00:44:03,665 --> 00:44:05,025
and Punishments Regulations,

536
00:44:05,105 --> 00:44:06,705
it is submitted to the Provincial
Public Security Department

537
00:44:06,785 --> 00:44:10,185
that Officer He Yuanhang should be awarded
a second-class individual merit."

538
00:44:17,585 --> 00:44:20,265
The police station specifically
requested me to give it to you in person.

539
00:44:22,625 --> 00:44:25,225
SECOND-CLASS MERIT MEDAL
OF THE MINISTRY OF PUBLIC SECURITY OF PRC

540
00:44:29,065 --> 00:44:31,065
NAME: HE YUANHANG
MEDAL: SECOND-CLASS MERIT

541
00:44:35,545 --> 00:44:37,345
I get custody of my daughter

542
00:44:38,745 --> 00:44:40,225
and the second-class merit.

543
00:44:41,105 --> 00:44:42,225
Let's see

544
00:44:43,185 --> 00:44:44,545
who dares call me
a good-for-nothing again.

545
00:44:47,905 --> 00:44:50,705
What are you doing?
I'm not done admiring it.

546
00:44:56,265 --> 00:44:57,665
Once you recover,

547
00:44:57,745 --> 00:44:59,625
you must take your medications
for your condition on time.

548
00:44:59,705 --> 00:45:01,785
It's time to quit drinking cola.

549
00:45:01,865 --> 00:45:03,905
The same goes for cigarettes,
alcohol, and fatty meat.

550
00:45:04,505 --> 00:45:07,225
-The doctor even mentioned to--
-Enough.

551
00:45:07,305 --> 00:45:09,945
Stop nagging beside me. All right?

552
00:45:10,025 --> 00:45:11,105
You're so annoying.

553
00:45:11,625 --> 00:45:13,905
Go back and keep working, Deputy Captain.

554
00:45:30,145 --> 00:45:31,225
He.

555
00:45:31,305 --> 00:45:33,465
If you didn't push me away,

556
00:45:33,545 --> 00:45:37,105
I'd probably be the one lying here now.

557
00:45:39,305 --> 00:45:43,145
I told you not to nag. All right?

558
00:45:45,145 --> 00:45:46,385
Do you think I did it for you?

559
00:45:48,145 --> 00:45:49,785
I did it for myself.

560
00:45:49,865 --> 00:45:52,065
If I let my apprentice get hurt,

561
00:45:52,145 --> 00:45:55,225
