as your mentor.

562
00:45:55,305 --> 00:45:56,905
It shows how incapable I am.

563
00:45:57,505 --> 00:45:58,905
Go away.

564
00:45:59,785 --> 00:46:01,065
Don't disturb my rest.

565
00:46:44,185 --> 00:46:45,145
I'm leaving,

566
00:46:46,185 --> 00:46:47,065
sir.

